<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "kepada Perbadanan; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@> .
