<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Sekuriti yang dikehendaki diterbitkan menurut seksyen ini hendaklah—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@> .
