<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/17/msa@> .
